00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 10.5 · Legal, Compliance, Policies & Risk
Safeguarding

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Safeguarding starts with your very first activity, including pilots, even in a team of two.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Name a lead, a deputy and someone outside the founders.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Design safe activities: supervision, two adults, online rules.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Get local expert advice before your first activity.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You outline your safeguarding framework, without case details.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
